stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> requested : Seller requests (amount held)
  requested --> processing : Admin approves, payOS payout created
  requested --> rejected : Admin rejects with reason (amount released)
  requested --> cancelled : Seller cancels (amount released)
  processing --> paid : payOS payout succeeded
  processing --> rejected : payOS payout failed (amount released)
  paid --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
